  "_about": "Extra matching rules for fleet.py. makes: registry make (tozar, Hebrew) -> site make. models: {registry make: {site car: [extra registry names]}} (a registry make can point at another site make, e.g. Mini is registered under BMW). prefixes: registry-name prefixes to strip before matching ('*' = every make; the site make name is always tried). exclude: registry names (prefix) that must not be counted for that make, because they are a different car. class_rules: a prefix followed by a digit means that model (Mercedes 'C200' -> C-Class, BMW '318I' -> 3 Series).",
